cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use HADES in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "HADES: Autonomous AI Software Company for Claude Code"
abstract: >-
  HADES is an open-source multi-agent framework that turns Claude Code into an
  autonomous AI software company. A team of AI coding agents (business analyst,
  software architect, engineers, QA, DevOps and cybersecurity) analyses, builds,
  tests, security-scans and commits code, with token-efficient handoffs and a
  deterministic safety guard. It also runs in OpenAI Codex, Cursor, Gemini CLI
  and GitHub Copilot.
type: software
